# Cursor Rules for zn-apps Monorepo

You are assisting in a Vue 3 + Vite monorepo for independent PWAs deployed to GitHub Pages.

MANDATORY CONTEXT:
Read documentation organized in two tiers before making changes:
- Monorepo root guidelines (`docs/`):
  - Index: `docs/README.md`
  - Architecture & conventions: `docs/00-overview.md`
  - App types & overrides: `docs/01-app-types.md`
  - Workflow & PWA: `docs/02-workflow.md`
  - Unit testing: `docs/05-testing.md`
  - Developer guide: `README.md`
- Project-specific docs (`<subproject>/docs/README.md`):
  - UI library: `shared/ui-core/docs/README.md`
  - Storage: `shared/storage/docs/README.md`
  - About: `shared/ui-about/docs/README.md`
  - Zound Box: `zound-box/docs/README.md`
  - Kitchensink: `kitchensink/docs/README.md`

RULES:
- `shared/` contains isolated libraries: `ui-core` (`@zn-apps/ui-core`, Vue/MD3) and `storage` (`@zn-apps/storage`, persistence). Libraries must not import from each other.
- Shared components use `Zn*` prefix in `shared/ui-core/src/components/` and Material Design 3 CSS tokens (`--md-*`).
- Each PWA in subfolders is independent. Do NOT share Pinia store instances across apps.
- When creating new apps, follow the pattern from `kitchensink/`, not legacy `pwa-app*`.
- Verify changes with `npm run test:run` and `npm run build:all` ONLY when modifying code (skip tests/builds for pure documentation tasks).
